    "useInstead": "docs/evidence/pass86/hf422/foot-contact-analysis.json and scripts/animation/hf422-foot-contact-analysis.mjs.",
    "toolNotPatched": "measure-retarget-quality.mjs is outside Lane AO ownership and was NOT modified. The exact patch (contiguous runs, band-fraction refusal, and an accessor refusal for the meshopt-compressed shipped GLB) is in the lane report."
